Subject: How does STAN define priors on covariance matrices?
Message-ID: <jk-_3gEGwLQ.PM2bKI0LeckJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/jk-_3gEGwLQ/m/PM2bKI0LeckJ>
