Another typo.
Page 135: in the generated quantities block,

alpha <- sd(y) * (alpha_std + beta_std * mean(x) / sd(x)) + mean(y);

should read:

alpha <- sd(y) * (alpha_std - beta_std * mean(x) / sd(x)) + mean(y);

Sergio

